  elements being consumed by the processes on a first-come first-served basis.
  One possible result is that process 1 prints

  ```
  [0, 2, 4]
  [0, 1, 3]
  [1]
  ```

  and process 2 prints

  ```
  [1, 3]
  [2, 4]
  [0, 2, 3, 4]
  ```

